{"t": 1793282770834, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "laws-preview", "Laws tab only describes the law currently in force (e.g. 'No tax: members keep their coin'); the effect of High taxes (3 coins/10s, loyalty falls fast, no immigrants) and Conscription On (members gather 40% less) is only revealed after it is enacted and has taken effect 30 s later. No hover/preview of an option before choosing it. Also a 1-member nation shows 'Taxes: 0 coins' with no hint taxes need members."]}
