{"t": 1793282926562, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "talk-flee", "Recruiting is very hard: pawns are Strangers ('I don't even know you' needs Acquaintance), and after one E-talk they walk off; repeated E presses 1 s later say 'No entities within range'. pt walkto repeatedly times out chasing pawns at ~3 fps. Within ~15 min every nearby pawn had founded/joined its own nation (10+ nations by day 1 morning), so a solo player nation stays at 1 member."]}
